# builds a smallish mailbox using COPY
depends correctbody
send 1
a copy 1:* inbox
receive 4
* 64 EXISTS
* 64 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 65] next uid
a OK [COPYUID 1 1:32 33:64] done
send 1
b copy 1:* inbox
receive 4
* 128 EXISTS
* 128 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 129] next uid
b OK [COPYUID 1 1:64 65:128] done
send 1
c copy 1:* inbox
receive 4
* 256 EXISTS
* 256 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 257] next uid
c OK [COPYUID 1 1:128 129:256] done
end
